# Fertile Ground (adoulin, call-only): a level 99 Warrior in Western Adoulin, SoA Pioneer Registration completed and
# Life on the Frontier current, a Broken Harpoon (a GM). Nothing begins or completes the quest (GMs). Talks in pairs
# (Shipilolo's default, Pioneer Registration's 535 replaceDefault, then his script). Both quests available, the
# Broken Harpoon held: nothing; a trade: no onTrade, nothing. Fertile Ground and The Old Man and the Harpoon accepted
# (GMs): the harpoon's 2543 answers first, finished: the Broken Harpoon taken, the Extravagant given. Then without
# the Bottle of Fertilizer X: 2850, finished: the bottle (addKeyItem, no message). The bottle held: nothing. The
# bottle taken, the quest completed (GMs): nothing.
lists WesternAdoulin/Shipilolo/onTrigger WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2543 WesternAdoulin/onEventFinish/2850
char zone=WesternAdoulin pos=86,0,-60.6 job=WAR lvl=99
mission Soa PioneerRegistration completed
mission Soa LifeOnTheFrontier current
keyitem BrokenHarpoon
item FlintStone
login
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # both available, the Broken Harpoon: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
trade Shipilolo FlintStone x1           # available: no onTrade: nothing, the stone kept
quest Adoulin.FertileGround accepted    # a GM
quest Adoulin.TheOldManAndTheHarpoon accepted   # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the harpoon first: 2543
finish-if-event                         # 2543's finish
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # no bottle: 2850
finish-if-event                         # 2850's finish: the bottle
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # the bottle held: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
delkeyitem BottleOfFertilizerX          # a GM
quest Adoulin.FertileGround completed   # a GM
trigger Shipilolo                       # 535
finish-if-event
trigger Shipilolo                       # completed, no bottle: nothing: 535
finish-if-event
